<title>AUSTRIA: Randa sees poss '96 div rise for Bank Austria, CA.</title>
<headline>Randa sees poss '96 div rise for Bank Austria, CA.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Austria chief executive Gerhard Randa said on Monday he saw a possible dividend rise for Bank Austria and Creditanstalt for 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;Both banks will have to discuss this but there is good reaon to believe that the dividend will be a bit higher for both banks,&quot; he told a news conference.</p>
</text>
